  "question": {
    "text": "If <math><mo>-</mo><mi>π</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>π</mi><mo>,</mo></math> the equation <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> has more than two roots for",
