  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given equation has more than two roots if it is an identity<br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>2</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0&#160;</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;3</mo><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> which does not satisfy <math><mn>2</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Hence, no value possible</p>",
